WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.905
Welcome to TrackVerse. Turn small daily actions into visible progress. This
quick

2
00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:11.510
guide shows you how to plan habits, check in each day, and

3
00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:17.115
understand your progress. The tracker shown here uses demonstration data,
separate from

4
00:00:17.115 --> 00:00:18.517
your personal habits.

5
00:00:19.917 --> 00:00:24.662
When you open TrackVerse for the first time, choose Set up locally

6
00:00:24.662 --> 00:00:29.406
to begin on this device. Or choose Continue with Google for optional

7
00:00:29.406 --> 00:00:34.151
private Google Sheets backup. Your habits are still saved locally in SQLite,

8
00:00:34.151 --> 00:00:36.128
so daily tracking works offline.

9
00:00:37.528 --> 00:00:42.396
To begin, click New habit at the top right of the habit

10
00:00:42.396 --> 00:00:47.264
tracker card. Give your habit a clear name, such as Read twenty

11
00:00:47.264 --> 00:00:52.133
pages. Choose its category, icon, color, and scheduled weekdays. Then choose
whether

12
00:00:52.133 --> 00:00:56.595
it belongs to this month only, or all months, and save.

13
00:00:57.995 --> 00:01:02.576
Each row is a habit, and each column is a day. Find

14
00:01:02.576 --> 00:01:07.158
today’s highlighted date and click the cell for the habit you completed.

15
00:01:07.158 --> 00:01:11.739
Click again if you need to undo today’s check-in. TrackVerse follows your

16
00:01:11.739 --> 00:01:15.557
local system date. Past days and future dates stay locked.

17
00:01:16.957 --> 00:01:21.351
Use the plus button beside the month tabs to add a month.

18
00:01:21.351 --> 00:01:25.744
Choose Use same habits to carry over your routine, or Start fresh

19
00:01:25.744 --> 00:01:30.138
for a new plan. This makes it easy to adapt for exam

20
00:01:30.138 --> 00:01:34.532
season or a different schedule. Future month tabs can be deleted. Current

21
00:01:34.532 --> 00:01:36.363
and past months are protected.

22
00:01:37.763 --> 00:01:42.944
Your dashboard updates automatically as you check in. See your completion
rate,

23
00:01:42.944 --> 00:01:48.124
total check-ins, best current streak, and active habit count. The subtle
curve

24
00:01:48.124 --> 00:01:53.305
in the navigation bar shows your daily consistency. Scroll below the tracker

25
00:01:53.305 --> 00:01:58.485
for the full consistency chart and Today at a glance. Use these

26
00:01:58.485 --> 00:02:00.644
patterns to adjust your routine.

27
00:02:02.044 --> 00:02:06.808
Make the workspace comfortable for you. Switch between light and dark
appearance.

28
00:02:06.808 --> 00:02:11.573
In Settings, open Appearance and Typography to choose your font and increase

29
00:02:11.573 --> 00:02:16.337
or decrease the overall text size. Use Find a habit and the

30
00:02:16.337 --> 00:02:19.910
category filter to focus on the habits you need.

31
00:02:21.310 --> 00:02:26.505
SQLite keeps your habits available without an internet connection. If you
connect

32
00:02:26.505 --> 00:02:31.700
Google, TrackVerse creates private backup sheets and syncs when you are
online.

33
00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:36.895
New month tabs are mirrored to the connected spreadsheet. Before
reinstalling, confirm

34
00:02:36.895 --> 00:02:42.090
your tracker says Backed up. Sign in with the same Google account

35
00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:47.285
to recover synced progress. Settings also lets you export a local backup.

36
00:02:48.685 --> 00:02:53.853
Use separate trackers for your regular routine, exam preparation, or other
goals.

37
00:02:53.853 --> 00:02:59.020
Give each tracker a meaningful alias and switch between them when needed.

38
00:02:59.020 --> 00:03:04.188
You can also delete a connected tracker after confirmation. Its spreadsheet
moves

39
00:03:04.188 --> 00:03:09.355
to Google Drive Trash. Start with one achievable habit, then build from

40
00:03:09.355 --> 00:03:09.786
there.

